      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me call you back in a minute.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Где, в зоопарк пришел?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where did I just walk in, a zoo?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А что это мы хомячим, а?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what are we all munching on here, huh?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Надеюсь, не за мой счет, а?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not on my tab, I hope, huh?'",
      "gap": 0.45
